WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:26.609
When you visit the baths

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:31.197
first wash your body,
then use the bagno

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:36.077
No diving, no splashing

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:41.291
Put your towel on your head,
then it's paradise

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:46.046
Let's all get a good soak

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:50.258
Tanto, tanto

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:54.387
That steamy aroma

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:58.808
of our land of Roma!

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:03.104
Let's meet across time

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:06.941
Thermae Romae

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:31.174
Viva tiamo! Roma!

